{"id":"000VUU","title":"Sternenburg (Star Battle Fortress Fillomino)","author":"PrissyP","solvedCount":0,"difficulty":3,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-03T06:56:05+00:00","posted":"Heute, 06:31 Uhr","rules":"Rules\n\nFortress Fillomino:\n\n• Divide the grid into orthogonally connected regions and fill each cell with a number (not necessarily single-digit) showing the number of cells in the region to which it belongs.\n\n• Each region must be either high (strictly larger than all of its orthogonal neighbours) or low (strictly smaller than all of its orthogonal neighbours).\n\nStar Battle:\n\n• Fill some cells with stars so that each row, column, and region contains two stars.\n\n• Stars cannot be placed in adjacent cells that share an edge or corner.\n\n• One star has been given.\n\nKropki Dots:\n\n• A white dot separates regions whose size differs by 1.\n\n• A black dot separates two regions where one is twice the size of the other.\n\n• Not all possible dots are necessarily given.\n\nBattenburg:\n\n• A Battenburg marking is placed on a point where the four surrounding cells form a 2×2 checkerboard of high and low cells (diagonally opposite cells are both high or both low).\n\n• All such points are marked.\n\nPlay in SudokuPad","solutionCode":"Row 2 digits, left to right, with a * behind the digits for cells with a star\nExample: 1777*773355*","tags":["Doppelstern","Fillomino","Kariertes Fillomino","Fortress (Variante)","Battenburg (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/1vo8n9q94k","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/1vo8n9q94k","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":10,"cols":10,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-03T06:56:05+00:00"}